<section class="content">
  <h1 data-aos="fade-immediately" class="main-heading">
    Empowering Change, Driving Innovation, and Championing Sustainability: Welcome to EKKO NOW 
  </h1>

  <div class="flex-section">
    <!-- Row 1 -->
    <div  data-aos="fade-right" class="flex-item text">
      <h1 class="title">About Us</h1>
      <p>
        EKKO NOW is a disruptive media-tech company at the intersection of media,
        technology, and climate advocacy. Our mission is to empower individuals,
        businesses, and communities by providing access to knowledge, opportunities,
        and sustainable solutions through storytelling, digital innovation,
        and community-driven engagement.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div data-aos="fade-left" class="flex-item image">
      <img src="/images/new/3rd.png" alt="About Us Image">
    </div>

    <!-- Row 2 -->
    <div data-aos="fade-right"  class="flex-item image">
      <img src="/images/new/2nd.png" alt="Mission Image">
    </div>
    <div data-aos="fade-left" class="flex-item text">
      <h1 class="title">Our Mission</h1>
      <h2 class="subtitle">Inspire Change</h2>
      <p>
        We’re here to bring about change, shape the future, 
        unlock opportunities, and champion climate action by
         merging media, technology, and sustainability-driven solutions.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Row 3 -->
    <div data-aos="fade-up" class="flex-item text">
      <h1 class="title">Our Vision</h1>
      <h2 class="subtitle">Connect People<br> to Opportunities</h2>
      <p>
        We’re here to be the  leading media-tech platform connecting
